% Mutual recursion: even and odd are defined through each other, so neither
% is complete until the stratum reaches its fixpoint.  Around a four-cycle
% the two relations stay disjoint, which is what makes this more than a
% termination test.
edge(a, b).
edge(b, c).
edge(c, d).
edge(d, a).

start(a).

even(X) :- start(X).
odd(X) :- even(Y), edge(Y, X).
even(X) :- odd(Y), edge(Y, X).

even(X)?
odd(X)?
